('7360340c-3ecf-4812-bfe2-dc618d767b16', 'China Orthopedic Memory Foam Lumbar Pillow Back Support Cushion for Long Sitting Hours', 'china-orthopedic-memory-foam-lumbar-pillow-back-support-cushion-for-long-sitting-hours', '534500842_BD-2551165931', '914005', NULL, NULL, '✅Made in China✅Brand New and Good Quality ✅Same Look as picture ✅Color Ash and Black ✅ Ergonomic Design – Contoured to fit the natural curve of your spine, supporting your lower back and reducing strain. ✅ High-Density Memory Foam – Maintains shape and firmness over time for consistent support and comfort. ✅ Breathable Mesh Cover – Promotes air circulation to keep you cool and comfortable throughout the day. ✅ Adjustable Straps – Dual straps ensure the cushion stays securely in place on any chair. ✅ Pain Relief & Posture Correction – Helps alleviate back pain caused by prolonged sitting and encourages proper spinal alignment. ✅ Removable & Washable Cover – Easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting freshness.Perfect For:Office workers Remote employees Drivers or frequent travelers Gamers Anyone experiencing lower back discomfort Orthopedic Memory Foam Lumbar Pillow Back Support Cushion for Long Sitting HoursOverview: This ergonomically designed lumbar support pillow is crafted with premium memory foam to provide optimal back support, relieve pressure, and encourage proper posture during long hours of sitting. Ideal for office chairs, home workstations, gaming chairs, or even car seats.', 1199, 1199, 1199, 0, 0, 0, '/uploads/products/111a31e5-d7a6-4fd0-a8d6-87a9ab27a247.webp', 'caf01276-a5ea-486e-a81f-bbf142876443', 1199, 'pending', '2026-09-02 15:19:29.631895+00', '2026-09-02 15:19:29.631895+00'),
