 Load-Shedding</p><p>🏪 Shops &amp; Small Businesses</p><p>🏢 Offices &amp; Workspaces</p><p>🎉 Outdoor Events &amp; Gatherings</p><p>🛠️ Emergency Backup Lighting</p><p>The JYSUPER JY-2096 combines long-lasting battery life, flexible brightness modes, and dependable LED lighting in one easy-to-use package — making it a must-have for every home and business in Bangladesh.</p><p>Order now and stay prepared for the next power outage!</p><p>📦 100\% Genuine Product</p><p>🚚 Fast Delivery Across Bangladesh</p><p>✅ Trusted by Thousands of Customers</p>', 625, 570, 570, 15, 100, 1, '/uploads/products/1065526c-dc21-4783-99d1-fda1eed40fd5.webp', 'b7246e62-3008-461c-bbd6-8fb4f2b49948', 570, 'approved', '2026-09-08 06:04:47.908425+00', '2026-09-08 14:12:26.098641+00'),
