('892ca02f-1371-47d0-bb88-a1f934e6afea', 'Stay Connected With 2 In 1 Usb Type C Otg Card Reader Tf Sd Memory Card Adapter - Convenient Data Transfer Solution', 'stay-connected-with-2-in-1-usb-type-c-otg-card-reader-tf-sd-memory-card-adapter-convenient-data-transfer-solution', NULL, '482420', NULL, '4ccdaac8-ec12-4756-aa30-4045e256a0c6', 'Supported Storage : 16GB-128GB Color will be chosen RANDOMLY NO RETURN applicable if the seal is broken Brand: PRC Model: USB & Type C OTG Color: Black Supported: MicroSD Upto 128GB USB: 2.0 What sets Shop-X apart is our commitment to quality, affordability, and customer satisfaction. We believe that style should never come at the expense of your budget, and we constantly strive to offer competitive prices without compromising on excellence.Introducing the 2-in-1 USB Type C OTG Card Reader: Your Essential Memory Card Companion!The 2-in-1 USB Type C OTG Card Reader is the ultimate solution for anyone seeking a hassle-free way to manage and transfer data from TF and SD memory cards to their USB Type C-equipped devices. This versatile card reader is designed to simplify your digital life, offering convenience, speed, and compatibility in a compact package.**Seamless Data Transfer:** With this card reader, you can effortlessly transfer files, photos, videos, and more between your memory cards and USB Type C devices, such as smartphones, tablets, laptops, and desktop computers. Say goodbye to cumbersome file transfers and embrace efficient data management.**Universal Compatibility:** The USB Type C OTG Card Reader ensures broad compatibility with a wide range of memory card formats, including TF (Micro SD) and SD cards. Whether you need to access your camera\'s SD card or your smartphone\'s Micro SD card, this reader has you covered.**Plug-and-Play Convenience:** No drivers or additional software needed. Simply plug the card reader into your USB Type C port, insert your memory card, and start accessing or transferring data instantly. It\'s a user-friendly solution suitable for all skill levels.**Compact and Portable:** Designed with portability in mind, this card reader is ultra-compact and lightweight. Slip it into your pocket, bag, or laptop case, and you\'ll have reliable memory card access wherever you go.**OTG Functionality:** The On-The-Go (OTG) capability of this card reader allows you to connect it directly to your smartphone or tablet, expanding their storage options and simplifying data management on the go.**High-Speed Data Transfer:** Benefit from the high-speed USB 3.0 technology for rapid data transfer rates. Whether you\'re dealing with large multimedia files or numerous documents, you\'ll experience swift and efficient transfers.**Durable and Reliable:** Crafted from quality materials, this card reader is built to withstand daily use. Its robust construction ensures long-lasting performance and dependable data access.**Versatile Applications:** Whether you\'re a photographer, student, professional, or tech-savvy enthusiast, the 2-in-1 USB Type C OTG Card Reader is an indispensable tool for managing and transferring your digital content effortlessly.Simplify your data management and enhance your digital workflow with the 2-in-1 USB Type C OTG Card Reader. Experience the convenience and speed of this essential accessory as you effortlessly access, transfer, and back up your data from TF and SD memory cards. Elevate your digital experience and make data management a breeze with this versatile card reader by your side.', 65, 60, 60, 15, 100, 1, '/uploads/products/d228bb15-1bb2-4b35-abe5-5ffb72978fbd.webp', 'b7246e62-3008-461c-bbd6-8fb4f2b49948', 60, 'approved', '2026-09-03 06:07:53.900861+00', '2026-09-06 10:27:57.962855+00'),
