('9479138f-b4ba-41b3-80ec-40d6bcec14cd', 'Moxx MDC-6C 3 in 1 USB Charger Cable 100W Fast Charging', 'moxx-mdc-6c-3-in-1-usb-charger-cable-100w-fast-charging', '389831436_BD-1944395258', '592320', NULL, 'bc5504bf-72a3-402b-9081-906e0e199c21', '3-in-1 Fast Charging: Supports charging multiple devices simultaneously. 120W Super Fast Charging: Ensures rapid charging for all compatible devices. Type C 6A: High-speed charging capability for Type C devices. Type B 2A: Efficient charging for Type B devices. Lightning 2.4A: Quick charging for Lightning devices (iOS). LED Indicator: Indicates charging status at a glance. Strong Braided Cable: Durable and tangle-free design for longevity and convenience. What sets Shop-X apart is our commitment to quality, affordability, and customer satisfaction. We believe that style should never come at the expense of your budget, and we constantly strive to offer competitive prices without compromising on excellence.Experience unparalleled charging speed and versatility with our premium 3-in-1 fast charging cable. Delivering an impressive 120W super fast charging capability, this cable supports Type C at 6A, Type B at 2A, and Lightning at 2.4A, ensuring rapid power delivery to multiple devices simultaneously. The built-in LED indicator provides clear charging status, while the strong braided cable design enhances durability and prevents tangling. Ideal for those who demand efficiency and reliability, this cable is a must-have accessory for powering up your devices quickly and securely.', 330, 300, 300, 15, 20, 1, '/uploads/products/d8811759-60c1-4fd9-aad6-ad4df882efb2.webp', 'b7246e62-3008-461c-bbd6-8fb4f2b49948', 300, 'approved', '2026-09-03 06:16:38.639573+00', '2026-09-06 09:12:20.848503+00');
