('31e48f1e-595e-4a18-9e7b-cd995c4e3036', 'DC 4.2V 500mA Smart Charger for 18650 Li ion Battery with 30cm Cable', 'dc-4-2v-500ma-smart-charger-for-18650-li-ion-battery-with-30cm-cable', NULL, '957207', NULL, 'bc5504bf-72a3-402b-9081-906e0e199c21', 'Output Current: 0.5A Model Number: 4.2V 200mAh smart charger suitable battery: 3.7v li-ion 26650 /18650/14500/16340 flashlight battery , Torch , Flashlight, Headlamp output: DC4.2V 200mAh certificate: ce material: plastic input voltage: AC 100-240Vsocket cable length: 30cm Introducing the 4.2V 500mA Smart Charger, a versatile and reliable solution for powering your essential devices. This charger is specifically designed to accommodate a range of 3.7V Li-ion batteries, including the 26650, 18650, 14500, and 16340 types commonly used in flashlights, torches, and headlamps. With an output current of 0.5A and a DC output of 4.2V, it ensures efficient and safe charging for your batteries. The charger features a durable plastic construction and is equipped with a 30cm cable for added convenience. Certified with CE for safety and quality assurance, it operates seamlessly with an input voltage range of AC 100-240V, making it suitable for use in various regions around the world. Keep your devices powered and ready with this essential smart charger.', 110, 100, 100, 15, 50, 1, '/uploads/products/7a806093-8dcf-4da8-b114-b21c9622c139.webp', 'b7246e62-3008-461c-bbd6-8fb4f2b49948', 100, 'approved', '2026-09-03 06:00:45.779446+00', '2026-09-06 10:33:11.599972+00'),
